      "Panic Projection": {
        "category": "ultimate",
        "description": {
          "raw": "Pandora's box holds both calamity and hope. Passive. Pandora herself is protected by hope and is not affected by this skill. Active. Pandora opens the box to unleash calamity, causing all units on the battlefield to flee in fright toward their own side for 5s and lose 50% (ATK-based) + 5% (SP-based) HP per 0.5s in the process. When the fright effect wears off, their ATK is reduced by 10% for 8s. This attack reduction effect can stack up to 3 times.",
