      "Boxed Blessing": {
        "category": "skill1",
        "description": {
          "raw": "When a battle starts, Pandora pulls the rearmost ally into her box, making them invincible but unable to cast skills. After 4s, the ally is released from the box. If Pandora is alive when that happens, the ally gains 1000 Energy, as well as 35% + 5% (SP-based) ATK for the next 10s.",
