            "The number of unique debuffs is equal to Pandora's current Corruption stacks.",
            "These debuffs may include: reducing Haste by 45, reducing Energy recovery by 45%, reducing Vitality by 45, or causing the affected unit's normal attacks to have a 45% chance to miss.",
            "These effects do not stack."
          ],
          "upgrades": [
            {
              "level": "2",
